an association from state id to the ids of the edges that state holds\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"d6ab3d7b-27bf-d54d-82f2-09f683e8e421"]}
  }]], "2ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"9e08ca82-7d66-1646-8eab-\
ce5e32ec5b15"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["prop"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b1450df0-84ae-8f48-aa27-3fc68f3f5816"],
 " may also be a list of property strings, in which case an association keyed \
by those strings is returned."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"9a72c0b2-89e9-5045-8a2d-22b983371d4a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Any ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"*", "Graph"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "42c62fef-71d9-6440-97c9-03b7a8f5e53c"],
 " property may take the suffix ",
 Cell[BoxData["Structure"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ad391d2-a809-2248-8365-31ab14b3565d"],
 " to return the same graph without vertex styling (a lighter-weight \
rendering), e.g. ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<StatesGraphStructure\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "65cf7a3e-da38-3849-b065-84d98e5a1eca"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c54614f3-0b31-ea4b-bb43-fdf7d7a97a78"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A raw ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<States\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "56ed565f-7a32-db4c-8cdf-e3da11edfed1"],
 " result is a list of associations, one per state, with keys ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Id\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "d97e28db-c743-954f-a172-deed78970b88"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<CanonicalId\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "ac3dd3e0-5495-d448-841a-90310ae7dc15"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Step\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e1dff1d-7fca-bc40-839c-e8b0c9f29335"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<IsInitial\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4d79069b-44a6-0b41-9adf-38032968005b"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Edges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1b501a19-c4d2-3041-a1e9-eb26845c0071"],
 " (the state's hyperedges), and \[LongDash] when ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<IncludeCanonicalHashes\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "True"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b9204d5b-05c7-d94f-a085-20e7cc33e5ef"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<CanonicalHash\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1e57ed77-7fa7-ea4a-8d5d-de009475fc9b"],
 ". A raw ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Events\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "552d5154-3782-8946-aa5d-5eb957bfdce4"],
 " result is a list of associations with keys ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Id\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fe531a8b-71dc-fe4d-bcc9-296b376b6774"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<CanonicalId\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "44ade28c-e74a-5646-8234-2cc5cbb3563a"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RuleIndex\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "bf7f609f-0aea-f14e-8bcf-b0045ac483fd"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Step\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "483759f5-e7ef-ba44-af20-4218c6f7ed3d"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<InputState\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e2b82721-325b-b444-b6af-e195c24061c4"],
 "/",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<OutputState\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2f925ded-6b1f-2f4b-899d-4d93a1c011be"],
 " (state ids), ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ConsumedEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0722272c-cb42-cb44-a09a-05820d764e39"],
 "/",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<ProducedEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c92b79c3-4315-904b-9ed1-77e9f7bf156f"],
 " (edge ids), and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<InputStateEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f72c7b21-c7e5-1c4d-8357-da6cd5facad2"],
 "/",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<OutputStateEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2fa3ee44-bbd7-3f4b-b390-347f62487b3a"],
 " (the full edge lists)."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"aa070ec8-8d10-834b-aeff-81d34a880a73"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Every state is a set of edges drawn from one global store, and the two \
properties below expose that store rather than the states built out of it. ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<GlobalEdges\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9a1ab8c3-27c2-b34d-8052-6694048e29c6"],
 " returns each edge once with its id, and ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<StateBitvectors\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9130fdca-4dfe-9342-b9ab-383870b96095"],
 " says which of those ids each state holds \[LongDash] so a state's contents \
are the edges its id list names, and two states sharing an edge name the same \
id."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"b0051906-36f8-ab42-beb2-82a96422cad7"],

Cell["\<\
State and event deduplication, exploration limits, and the output content are \
controlled by:\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"e0acc46f-6f70-a043-88a9-a652aac901a8"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "7c8e268b-6e14-3c47-aa39-333d0a32fd7a"], Cell["Option", "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"273cef48-4ede-224a-88cc-3ac07a686368"],
     Cell["Default", "TableText",
     FontWeight->Bold,ExpressionUUID->"a3288731-8093-e346-ac02-315df9ab907b"],
     Cell["", "TableText",
