     "aaf412a8-e014-9541-878a-28890e8c6cf4"], Cell["\<\
quotient exploration: expand each canonical state once, at its shortest depth \
(off by default, so every provenance is explored)\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"686fab90-34aa-7c4d-bd37-a73be560ce9e"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "0848163e-044b-ff45-8ab7-5bb6ca86a92c"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
